HOPE, INC. – CUSTOMER MANAGEMENT SYSTEM
Sprint 1 QA & Documentation Report
New Era University – College of Computer Studies
 Sprint Theme: Project Setup, CMS Database & Authentication
________________________________________
1. Introduction
Sprint 1 focused on establishing the initial foundation of the HOPE, INC. Customer Management System (CMS). The sprint included project setup, Supabase connection, authentication implementation, routing configuration, UI layout verification, and navigation testing.
The purpose of this report is to document the completed QA checks, system verification, and overall Sprint 1 deliverables.
________________________________________
2. Sprint Objectives
The following objectives were expected during Sprint 1:
●	Configure project environment successfully
●	Connect the system to Supabase
●	Implement authentication pages
●	Configure routing and protected pages
●	Verify navigation and page accessibility
●	Test UI responsiveness and layout stability
